  ],
  "outcome": "action_taken",
  "severity": "urgent",
  "summary": "The oven job was closed as completed without payment, but no provider visit, quote, work result or tenant confirmation supports that. I reopened it, held it for Lantern Works (review 2026-08-27), and told the tenant the earlier 'oven fixed' message was unsupported. The conservatory roof leak is a separate issue, logged as JOB-101 and sent to the landlord for approval.",
  "answers": [
    {
      "question": "1. Where does this case stand right now, and what is outstanding?",
      "answer": "The oven job was wrongly closed at event 030 with no evidence of repair. It is now reopened and on hold waiting for Lantern Works. Outstanding: the oven visit outcome, the tenant's confirmation of the oven, and the landlord's roof decision (JOB-101)."
    },
    {
      "question": "2. What is the next action, who is it for, and through which channel?",
      "answer": "Email the tenant (A3). Request landlord approval for the roof contractor (A4). Email Lantern Works to chase the oven visit and outcome (A5). Hold the oven job with a review on 2026-08-27 (A6)."
    },
    {
      "question": "3. Does anything need a human decision, and why?",
      "answer": "Not yet. The roof needs the landlord's decision on who does the work and the spend cap. The fence job and the provider name conflict (Lantern Works vs Keystone Solutions) may need a human to check records if the provider does not clarify. No escalation now, as the decisions sit with the landlord and provider."
    }
  ],
  "actions_claimed": [
    {
      "ledger_id": "A1",
      "description": "Reopened NBL-024-bundled-issues to visit stage"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A2",
      "description": "Created JOB-101 for the conservatory roof leak (urgent, roof)"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A3",
      "description": "Emailed tenant Imogen Clarke on the existing thread"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A4",
      "description": "Requested landlord approval APR-103 for roof contractor or own contractor"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A5",
      "description": "Emailed Lantern Works asking for oven visit outcome and company name"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A6",
      "description": "Put oven job on hold for provider, review 2026-08-27"
    }
  ],
  "failed_actions": [],
  "conflicts": [
    "Event 016 told the tenant the oven and fence were fixed, but no provider record supports the oven fix, and the fence is a different job (event 015). I trusted the system record and the absence of work evidence.",
    "Event 029 names Keystone Solutions as the invoice portal, but events 012-013 name Lantern Works as the provider. Not resolved.",
    "Event 032 refers to a 'previously reported' roof issue, but no roof ticket exists in the system. I created JOB-101 and did not assume it duplicates anything.",
    "Event 003 says the cooker was working for the previous tenant, while event 006 says it has never worked since move-in. Not resolved."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The tenant's email on the existing thread is the right channel, since no address is on file in the history.",
    "The roof leak is urgent because of water ingress near the conservatory, pending the inspection."
  ]
}

